        "body_swap: start with <image1> as the base image, keeping its lighting, environment, background and face completely unchanged. remove the body from <image1> completely and replace it with the body from <image2>. copy the exact body pose, arm position and movements from <image1>. transfer all the realistic skin details from <image2> including visible pores, natural skin texture variation, soft mottling, subtle color irregularities, natural oiliness and sheen, micro-imperfections and surface details. keep the skin looking natural, no plastic smoothness, no AI over-smoothing. photorealistic, highly detailed, sharp.\n"
